<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Mbembe Adun [mfn]</book>
  <para style="h">Rut</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rut</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nnwẹr kw'Rut</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nnwẹr kw'Rut</para>
  <para style="ip">Idik s'makkẹrẹ m'nnwẹr nwoma, iyinẹ k'ogbe kw'anọng p'Israẹl nkk'adima z'izek s'Kenaan, kw'ode izek s'Ibinọkpaabyi ọnwọhngọ ọnang bẹ. M'ogbese nwa, agbaak-ettem ch'Ibinọkpaabyi, p'ade Mosẹs ọttara Jọshua, nkk'apa; ogbe otima opyira, kw'Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang anọng p'Israẹl avaarnọng. M'ogbe nwoma, mayerẹ anọng p'abaabh Israẹl bẹ́, akpaar-aponga. Wa ode obhokọ kw'nkọhr ọttara irem. Akpaar-aponga mba bọ iwa made mach'avaarnọng p'Israẹl ny'ogbe nwo. Wa bẹ mad-attọhna idik anang anọng mach'avaarnọng, okurọ bẹ́, Israẹl avaarnọng otim oyena ny'ogbe nwo. Ibinọkpaabyi wọ iwa ọbaabh bẹ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Elimẹlẹk ọmaana ẹsọhmmọr chẹ machin z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />K'ogbe kw'uwa akpaar-aponga mabaabh Israẹl, wa okwo f'ọgaang-ọgaangẹ oning ny'izek s'Israẹl. Ojinọng wanẹ kw'ofon Bẹtẹlẹhẹm z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'Juda otima kwanọng kwẹ ọttara adikkobhva pẹ afa, mabina mad-aruk z'ẹkọma ch'Moab. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Ojinọng nwo okpen Ẹlimẹlẹk, kwanọng kwẹ okpena Naomi. Ajinọngva pẹ afa, oyok wanẹ okpen Malọn, nwoza okpena Kiliyọn. Bẹ maphyir wa made ámmáaná p'Ẹphrat z'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm z'ẹkọma ch'Juda. Mabina achina z'Moab maruk za.<verse eid="RUT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Ẹlimẹlẹk, kw'ode odim kw'Naomi, okwu ope, orik Naomi ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ afa. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Ajinọngva mbo makwu atọka panọng p'ade ámmáaná p'Moab. Kwanọng wanẹ okpen Ọpa, nwoza okpena Rut. Marukọ nya maa, opyirẹ ọttọhk k'icho ijobh. <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Malọn ọmaana Kiliyọn mabir ape, ọwọhkọ Naomi, ọdọk odim ọttara iva pẹ koyen.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi ọmaana Rut makpa nnam z'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />K'ogbe kw'Naomi oning z'Moab, ọbhaanga bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'anọng pẹ okwu ọkkaana, ọnang bẹ ọchattọhk, Naomi odo ifor bẹ́, otima anyẹ pẹ obina z'Moab ọkpa nnam z'ikẹ k'obhon. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Minna kw'Naomi otim anyẹ pẹ afa mabina, matọma ozenga achina z'ẹkọma ch'Juda.<verse eid="RUT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Naomi okwu oben anyẹ mbo pẹ afa bẹ́, “Ọnọng-ọnọng zọhng bhana z'ọsọhm kw'akka. Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ọphyaam ọnang bọnga, k'ose kw'bọnga nkk'asa anang kaam ọttara adim pabọnga p'apope. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang ọnọng-ọnọng ẹwọhngkwoka z'ọsọhm kw'odim ọbhakwẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Minna kw'ozeng ọbaaka bẹ, oben bẹ bẹ́, mayima. Bẹ panọng mbo mabhom amọng k'ẹrọng, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />maben-ẹ bẹ́, “Mma e, mina mm'otor-ọ mọbhana z'anọng pọ.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Okenaka, Naomi oben bẹ bẹ́, “Iva paam, màkpa nnam bhana z'abọnga k'obhon. Bọng-ọttọhk f'mm'azeng ábẹ̀ mator-m? Ma, bọnga machibhẹ bẹ́, yina kw'kaam m'mbir mmaan ajinọngva p'mm'akwu ade adim pabọnga yirẹ? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Iva paam, màkpa nnam. Kaam kk'ntama nyọhnga edimba. Zaabẹ́ kaam ntim nsok ichen k'edimba za, nkwu mba odim m'erungọ mmaan ajinọngva, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />bọnga mm'aninga atik bẹ mabar pira maba ayok o? Bọnga mmin'akpọka ọbada okurọ bẹ o? Mma e, iva paam, kaam kw'opyibh ọnang ọtam ọyọhnga bọnga, okurọ bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'nnam ọkpa ọbọr-m.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Minna kw'mabir abhom amọng. Ọpa ọbaaka ọkka kw'odim, oben-ẹ bẹ́, yima e. Okenaka, Rut ọgbana bẹ́, kẹ m'otor ọkka kw'odim.<verse eid="RUT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Naomi okwu oben Rut bẹ́, “Kirẹ e, oyok-bhọbha kk'nnam ọkpa z'anọng pẹ ọttara z'aka pẹ. Kọ tor-ẹ makpa nnam.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Rut ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Kaam kàbhọkọ bẹ́, nning-ọ ntorọ. Ibyi kpenamkpen s'ata, kaam m'nta. Ibyi kpenamkpen s'ayim, kaam m'nyima. Anọng pọ mm'ade anọng paam. Ibinọkpaabyi kw'akpobh, kẹ kw'kaam m'mbir mkpobha. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Ibyi kpenamkpen s'ape ayima, kaam m'mpe nya, mm'abir anọhng-m nya. Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang-m irem k'ose kpenamkpen kw'ọdaak-ẹ, ọttọhk kode f'im'ọbhaangẹ kaam ọttara kọ, ina obo kẹ-kẹ ode.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi okwu oze bẹ́, Rut kk'ifor ọda bẹ́, m'otor-ẹ mafona, ọdọk odik kpenamkpen kobenẹ.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Panọng mbo afa mazenga maa, makwu apyirẹ z'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm. Mapyirẹ za o, ẹlọ etto z'obhon maphyir okurọ bẹ́, panọng p'aning nya mad-abọbh ayok bẹ́, “Ma, Naomi wọ ma yirẹ?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Kẹ ọpọhna bẹ bẹ́, “M'kaam Naomi kàyerẹ! Màyer-m Mara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">oyinẹ bẹ́, ajobhiji.</char></note>, okurọ bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa maphyir kk'akpen paam ọsa majobhọ mawuriji. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Wa ntim oyena k'ọsaabh mbina nrik obhon, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otim-m okwuna mbọhk-mbọhk. Osempira mayer-m Naomi, ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa maphyir ikk'nnam ọkpa ọbọr-m?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Minna kw'uwa Naomi otim ọnyẹ kwẹ kw'ode Rut kw'ofon Moab, okwuna z'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm. Mapyirẹ za k'ogbe kw'mad-atọma ipha s'ọraasi-kira kw'mayerẹ, <char style="it">barli</char> osisi.<figure style="fig" alt="Two people harvesting" file="lb00098c.tif" size="col" loc="1.22" ref="1.22">Masi ipha</figure><verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Rut okebha Boaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Wa Naomi oyen ochinọng wanẹ kw'ode ofonanọng kw'odim kwẹ, Ẹlimẹlẹk. Ojinọng nwo okpen Boaz, obir ode ọnọng kw'oyinẹ eche mawuriji.<verse eid="RUT 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Ewu danẹ, Rut oben Naomi bẹ́, “Tte nyin ichorọ s'abarli-mọma z'anọng k'iwonọ, óde m'nze ọnọng kw'im'ochera bẹ́, nchorọ owonọ kwẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Naomi ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, china ororo, si k'ose kw'abenẹ nya.”<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Minna kw'Rut obin oyin, otor atọhmnọng nnam-nnam, ọd-ọpara abarli-mọma p'atto za. Kẹ kozong bẹ́, z'owonọ kw'Boaz kw'ode ofonanọng kw'Ẹlimẹlẹk wọ kw'od-oter ochorọ nya.<figure style="fig" alt="Heads of barley" file="lb00102c.tif" size="col" loc="2.3" ref="2.3">Ọraasi-kira kw'mayerẹ, barli</figure><verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Ogbe kobhirẹ, Boaz obina z'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm okwu okebha atọhmnọng mbo nya, ozima bẹ bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi odo bọnga!” Bẹ mapọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obir odo kọ ọdọk.”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boaz okwu ọbọbh okker-atọhmnọng bẹ́, “Ominanwa kw'anyi wọ kina?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Okker-atọhmnọng nwo ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Kẹ ode ominanwa kw'otorọ Naomi mabina z'ẹkọma ch'Moab makwuna. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Ophyem-m bẹ́, nttẹ-ẹ ọbọhk otor atọhmnọng mba nnam-nnam ọd-ọpara abarli-mọma. Tọma k'ekpebha osi ọtọhm mach'osi nya, kw'ọkpanẹ ẹwọhngkwoka biribirẹ ch'iwura oyen z'ofokodo.”<figure style="fig" alt="Grain sheaves" file="hk00100c.tif" size="col" loc="2.7" ref="2.7" /><verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Minna kw'Boaz oben Rut bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, yong-m itọhng. Ninga ma maana mina, ọdọk k'owonọ kpenamkpen kayin kw'ọkpanẹ owonọ kwaam. Tor panọngva mba masi ọtọhm m'kaam k'owonọ. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Ibyi kpenamkpen s'bẹ masi ipha, tor bẹ masi. Kk'ajinọng mbo itọhng ntọra bẹ́, maning-ọ itama asi. Ó̱de asi adaak-ọ, zọhng gwo z'njọ s'ajinọng nkk'asi akaabha ake.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Nya o, Rut ọraka otwu ititika ny'izek, ozim-ẹ mawuriji, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kaam nde okikennọng; nsi mbọng kw'asi ọphyaamse mva anang-m?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boaz ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ, “Nkk'aam ejibha kpenamkpen ch'asi anang akka kw'odim ateka, tọma za ch'odim kwọ ope, ọttara ose kw'abin arik atte, ọmaana akka, ọttara ọmmaana-obhon kwọ, akwu aruk amaana anọng p'ẹkọma ch'ina azong. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnwọhnga ejibha ch'ikk'asa ọnang-ọ. Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'anọng p'Israẹl akpobh, kw'ikọ abir arọbh ajena, ọtaam-ọ mawuriji.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Rut ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ttatta kwaam, tte nchina ororo ndaak-ọ idik. Kọ kk'aam nttem afoka, agbaak odik anang-m k'eden ọkkọkka, chibhẹ ch'ina ọtọhmnọng kwọ nde.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Otum k'ogbe kw'ọchattọhk, Boaz oyerẹ Rut bẹ́, okwu ochi ọttọhk, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tọka brẹd, bọhnga ny'atuk mbo, achi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:14">K'ose kw'Rut oning ẹwọr ọmaana atọhmnọng, Boaz ọtọka abarli-mọma p'nkk'abhaabha ọnang-ẹ. Rut ochi maa ọdọhbh, mabek. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />K'ogbe kw'Rut obin bẹ́, ochina ororo ogbenga abarli-mọma, Boaz oben atọhmnọng pẹ bẹ́, “Za wura ogbeng mbyo py'ening ny'ake, m'ikẹ kàlẹkẹ. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Màtera rọbha aso banẹ z'akkin p'nkk'atobha, manang-ẹ bẹ́, ogbenga. Tte ọnọng oning-ẹ ọgbọbhọ o!”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Minna kw'Rut ogbeng abarli-mọma mbo maa, ẹsọhka etto. Abarli-mọma mbo p'odukọ mafu ọgbangbang kwiden! <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Ọtọka abarli-mọma mbo, otima okwuna z'obhon, ọkọhka ọkka kw'odim. Obir ọnang-ẹ ọchattọhk f'ochi orik. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Ọkka kw'odim ọbọbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Memma kw'ayinẹ menda? K'owonọ kw'anyi kw'asi ọtọhm menda? Tte Ibinọkpaabyi odo ọnọng nwo kw'ọkọ-ọ otum.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Rut ọpọhna Naomi bẹ́, “Nsi ọtọhm z'owonọ kw'ọnọng kw'okpen Boaz.” <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Naomi oben ọnyẹ kwẹ bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi odo Boaz mawuriji! Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ejibha otim ọkpọka osisi ọnang anọng p'arukọ akpen ọttara p'nkk'apa.” Naomi obir oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Boaz ode ochinọng wanẹ kwamina kw'ode ọkkaan kw'echimma.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Rut, kw'ofon Moab, ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Kẹ Boaz oter oben-m bẹ́, nchina ororo nsi ọtọhm mmaana atọhmnọng pẹ maa, ipha sẹ isa.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi oben Rut bẹ́, “Ojibh-ojibh bẹ́, achina ororo asi ọtọhm amaana aminava mbo ny'Boaz k'owonọ, okurọ bẹ́, óde achin k'owonọ kw'ọnọng ọdọk-ọdọk, mm'alẹk-ọ ọlẹkẹ.”<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Minna kw'Rut osi ọtọhm ọmaana aminava mbo p'Boaz maa, ipha njo s'barli ọmaana s'wit, isa. Wa Rut orukọ ọmaana ọkka kw'odim kwẹ.<figure style="fig" alt="Heads of wheat" file="hk00099c.tif" size="col" loc="2.23" ref="2.23">Ọraasi-kira kw'mayerẹ wit</figure><verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Naomi osi nttọhna s'ọbada kw'Rut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Ewu danẹ, Naomi kw'ode ọkka kw'odim kw'Rut oben Rut bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, ma, wura kojibhẹ bẹ́, nnor odim kw'im'okker-ọ yirẹ? <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Boaz nwo kw'ad-asi ọtọhm amaana panọngva pẹ, ode ochinọng kwamina. Menda m'erungọ, m'ogwuma barli z'ọgbaarẹ kw'nd-aninga aduk barli. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Zọhng gbobha asi, achọkọ ana p'alebh eruk, afọra ẹnya ọkkọkka, pira achina z'ọgbaarẹ nwo kw'mad-aduk barli. Kàchera bẹ́, ọzọ-ọ, oyebẹ, kk'ọttọhk ọcha maphyir, obir ogwo atuk. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />M'ake otum mawuriji, aze ibyi s'im'oyima. Ó̱de ikk'oyima, zọhng wong-ẹ ibara, ayim-ẹ ny'mmokpatọkọ. Kẹ m'otek-ọ ọttọhk f'im'asi.”<figure style="fig" alt="Winnowing grain" file="hk00097c.tif" size="col" loc="3.4" ref="3.4">Mad-agwuma abarli-mọma</figure><verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Rut ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ose kpenamkpen kw'abenẹ, kaam m'nsi minna.”<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Minna kw'ofon ochina z'ọgbaarẹ kw'mad-aduk barli, osi k'ose kw'ọkka kw'odim ọtọhn-ẹ. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />K'ogbe kw'Boaz kk'ọttọhk ọcha maphyir, obir ogwo atuk, ettem elebh-ẹ, od-oyima z'eso danẹ ch'ọbarli-kkin nwo, ọttaabha ọda. Rut ozenga <char style="it">bẹ́ bẹẹm</char> okwu okpen-ẹ ibara ny'mmokpatọkọ, oyima nya. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Otum ny'orungittem, Boaz ogbe z'ọda, okkon-ẹ ch'oze kwanọng nwo kw'oyim nya.<verse eid="RUT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Ọbọbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Kọ anyi wọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Rut ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Kaam Rut kw'nde ọtọhmnọng kwọ wọ e. Ototo, tima ibara sọ bubh-m, ch'ode kọ wọ ade ochinọng kw'ode ọkkaan kw'echimma.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boaz oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọdọ-ọ. Ejibha ndoma ẹyọhng ndoza ch'akkikken asi. Kọ adikkobh p'ojibhẹ bẹ ojibh, wanẹma, p'opyibh bẹ opyibh, kakwubhọ. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Nnwa kwaam, oning-ọ ojor. M'nsi ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'arorọ nnang-ọ. Ayok-obhon paam maphyir mazong bẹ́, kọ ade kwanọng kw'ojibhẹ ẹmmaana mawuriji. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Ode odik ọkkọkka bẹ́, kaam nde ọkkaan kw'echimma. Okenaka, ochinọng oning za kw'ọnyọm-ọ ọtam ọyọhnga kaam. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Yima ma m'erungọ nda. Ophyinẹ k'ekpebha, óde ọdaak-ẹ bẹ́, okwu obhek-ọ, m'ojibh ojibh. Ó̱de ina kẹ ọdaakẹ bẹ́, obhek-ọ, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi orukọ akpen, kaam m'nsi-osi minna. Yima ma maa, ewu esobha.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Ofona nya o, Rut oyima ny'izek-izek kw'mmo sẹ maa, ewu esobha. Okenaka, okkikken obina pira ewu nẹttaanẹ. Boaz oben-ẹ bẹ́ “Tte ọnọng kpenamkpen oning ozong bẹ́, kwanọng okwu oyima m'ọgbaarẹ kw'nd-aduk barli.”<verse eid="RUT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Obir oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tima ibara njo s'abubh nya, kwu jẹ ny'ọgbaarẹ.” K'ose kw'otim okwu ọjẹ nya o, Boaz okpukọ abarli-mọma p'afu ọkariba ọchadanẹ, ọkẹ-ẹ nya, otinẹ ọyẹ-ẹ. Pira Boaz ọbhana z'obhon.<verse eid="RUT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Rut opyirẹ z'oter o, ọkka kw'odim ọbọbh-ẹ bẹ, “Nnwa kwaam, chena ode yen za?” Rut otek-ẹ ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'Boaz ikk'ọsa ọnang-ẹ. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Obir ọttara bẹ́, “Boaz ọnang-m ọkariba mvoma ọchadanẹ f'barli, oben-m bẹ́, nning mbọhk-mbọhk nzeng nkebha ọkka kw'odim kwaam za.”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Naomi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, ninga ma tik maa, aze odik kw'im'oyin. Ojinọng nwo ọwọhng mòkwoka maa, ọttọhna odik nwa menda.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Boaz ọtọk Rut k'ọbada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Ny'ogbese nwo, Boaz obina ochina z'ebhumma ch'obhon, oninga ẹwọr nya. K'ogbe kw'ọkkaan kw'echimma nwo kw'Boaz okkikken opyi ẹmọng okwu nya, Boaz oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ayi, kwuna ka, kwu ninga ẹwọr ma.” Minna kw'obin od-oninga ẹwọr nya.<verse eid="RUT 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Boaz otéka adidennọng ijobh p'obhon nwo, obenẹ bẹ bẹ́, “Màninga ma.” Makwu aninga nya. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Pira Boaz oben ọkkaan nwo kw'echimma bẹ́, “Naomi kw'okwun z'ẹkọma ch'Moab min'okpe izek s'Ẹlimẹlẹk kw'ode ọgbaanotte kwamina. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Kẹ wọ osi nchibhẹ bẹ́, nsọ-ọ azonga, mbir mben-ọ bẹ́, adebh sẹ m'ititika s'anọng mba p'aning ma, ọmaana m'ititika s'adidennọng p'anọng paam. Ó̱de ọ́daak-ọ bẹ́, m'abhek sẹ, tek-m. Ini kọ ọdaakẹ, tek-m, ọfha nzonga. Ọnọng kode kw'm'obhek sẹ kw'ọkpanẹ kọ. Ọnọng kw'otor-ọ k'nnam ode kaam.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Ọkkaan kw'echimma nwo ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Iye, m'mbhek-obhek e.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Nya o, Boaz oben bẹ, “Ny'ewu ch'im'adebh izek nja ny'Naomi k'mbọhk, m'abir atọka Rut nwa kw'ode opokwa kw'ofon Moab, ọfha eche ch'odim ọttara oyena kwẹ, ening edimẹ.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Nya o, ọkkaan kw'echimma nwo ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ó̱de ode minna, kaam ọdọk mìmbhek, okurọ bẹ́, óde mbhekẹ, m'nyerẹ itama nnang oyena kwaam e. Kọ tọka eninga chaam, azeng mmo abhek. Kaam mìmbhek e.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Wa z'ogbe nwo, ẹmmaana ch'anọng p'Israẹl ede bẹ́, ọ́nọ́ng ọkamẹ bẹ́, obhek ọttọhk, ọnọng wanẹ m'ọwọra ọtọk-obho wanẹ kwẹ ọnang oyok. Eden ch'iwa anọng p'Israẹl mad-atima abhek, mabir abhona ekpo k'ayok k'mbọhk dọ nya.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Nya o, k'ose kw'ọkkaan kw'echimma nwo obenẹ Boaz bẹ́, “Kọ zeng mmo bhek,” ọwọra ọtọk-obho kwẹ ọnang Boaz.<verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Boaz oben adidennọng mbo ọttara anọng mboza maphyir p'aning nya bẹ́, “M'ewu ch'menda, bọnga bọ made anttẹsẹ paam bẹ́, kk'ekpo py'Ẹlimẹlẹk maphyir mbheka z'Naomi k'mbọhk, ọttara ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'ode f'Kiliyọn ọmaana f'Malọn. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Kaam mbir mbhek Rut kw'ofon Moab, opokwa kw'Malọn, ntọk-ẹ mach'kwanọng kwaam, ọfha eche ch'ikẹ kw'ikk'ọpa, ọttara oyena kwẹ, ening edimẹ ny'efona chẹ, ọttara ny'obhon kwẹ. Bọnga bọ made anttẹsẹ paam m'ewu ch'menda.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Adidennọng mbo ọttara anọng mboza p'aning ny'ebhumma, maben-ẹ bẹ́, “Iye, mina bọ mode anttẹsẹ e. Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi kwanọngnwa kw'im'odim m'ọsọhm kwọ ode mach'Rachẹl ọmaana Lea, p'magbak mbọhk masi efona ch'Israẹl ẹbar. Tte kọ akwu ade odidennọng m'Ẹphrat, abir ayena eche mawuriji m'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otima iva p'kwanọng nwa m'ọmaan, osi efona chọ ẹbar mach'ndo ch'Pẹrẹz kw'uwa Tamar ọmaanẹ ọnang Juda.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rut ọmaanẹ nnwa ọnang Naomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Ofona nya o, Boaz ọtọka Rut k'ọbada. Matọn ayim nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọsẹ-ẹ otima ibhọr, ọmaan ojinọngnwa. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Panọng p'obhon nwo maben Naomi bẹ́, “Mọ̀tọhnga Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'menda ikk'ọ ọkkaan kw'echimma ọnanga. Tte nnwa nwoma okwu ode ọnọng kw'im'oyena eche m'Israẹl maphyir. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Kẹ m'obhona akpen pọ, m'okker-ọ k'ogbe kw'ikk'atama. Ọnyẹ kwọ kw'adaak-ẹ, kw'obir ojibh ọtam ọyọhnga ajinọngva achenọmfa, kk'nnwa ọmaana ọnang-ọ.”<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Pira Naomi ọtọka nnwa nwo ọnana ny'ikẹ k'ntaak, ọrọk-ẹ. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Panọng p'arukọ nya aben bẹ́, “Naomi kk'ojinọngnwa oyena e!” Makpẹ-ẹ Ọbẹd. Ọbẹd wọ ode otte kw'Jẹsẹ. Jẹsẹ okwu ode otte kw'Devid.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ab'ttatta p'Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Ofona nya, efona ch'Pẹrẹz ede bẹ́:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:18">Pẹrẹz wọ wa obhonọ Hẹzrọn,<verse eid="RUT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hẹzrọn obhon Ram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:19">Ram obhon Aminadab,<verse eid="RUT 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadab obhon Nashọn,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:20">Nashọn obhon Salmọn,<verse eid="RUT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salmọn obhon Boaz,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:21">Boaz obhon Ọbẹd,<verse eid="RUT 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Ọbẹd obhon Jẹsẹ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:22">pira Jẹsẹ node otte kw'Devid.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>